1
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was wrong to suspect you.</font></font>

2
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't have to do this</font></font>

3
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:18,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to make it up to me.</font></font>

4
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I only want to know one thing.</font></font>

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you have feelings for your cousin?</font></font>

6
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does your silence mean yes?</font></font>

7
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That question</font></font>

8
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">doesn't warrant an answer.</font></font>

9
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But since you came back,</font></font>

10
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the only time I've seen you show any emotion</font></font>

11
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was when she fainted.</font></font>

12
00:00:34,710 --> 00:00:35,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're so concerned about her,</font></font>

13
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:37,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">yet you treat me like a stranger.</font></font>

14
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not her I'm concerned about.</font></font>

15
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're still lying.</font></font>

16
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:44,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you know how much gossip your trips into the mountains</font></font>

17
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have caused</font></font>

18
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:47,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in the village?</font></font>

19
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:49,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They all say</font></font>

20
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you've been keeping</font></font>

21
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:51,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a mistress in secret.</font></font>

22
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's the one,</font></font>

23
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:53,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't she?</font></font>

24
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you won't admit it,</font></font>

25
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll ask her myself.</font></font>

26
00:01:21,740 --> 00:01:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪</font></font>

27
00:01:29,660 --> 00:01:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪</font></font>

28
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:40,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Desire blinds my eyes♪</font></font>

29
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪</font></font>

30
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:59,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪</font></font>

31
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:07,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪</font></font>

32
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪</font></font>

33
00:02:16,780 --> 00:02:23,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪</font></font>

34
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Blossom in Darkness]</font></font>

35
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]</font></font>

36
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Episode 7]</font></font>

37
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan.</font></font>

38
00:02:44,430 --> 00:02:45,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What a coincidence. I was just going to see you.</font></font>

39
00:02:49,830 --> 00:02:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What is it?</font></font>

40
00:02:53,390 --> 00:02:54,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

41
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to thank you</font></font>

42
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for saving my unborn baby.</font></font>

43
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm pregnant,</font></font>

44
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">three months along now,</font></font>

45
00:03:07,110 --> 00:03:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I often feel weak.</font></font>

46
00:03:09,830 --> 00:03:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you for the well water.</font></font>

47
00:03:13,390 --> 00:03:15,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My husband and I came to pay a visit,</font></font>

48
00:03:15,550 --> 00:03:16,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but we never imagined</font></font>

49
00:03:16,190 --> 00:03:17,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'd cause you so much trouble.</font></font>

50
00:03:19,550 --> 00:03:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We... We're so sorry.</font></font>

51
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations.</font></font>

52
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pregnancy has made me moody</font></font>

53
00:03:30,270 --> 00:03:31,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and suspicious.</font></font>

54
00:03:31,430 --> 00:03:32,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hope I didn't frighten you.</font></font>

55
00:03:32,670 --> 00:03:33,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course not.</font></font>

56
00:03:33,550 --> 00:03:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How far along</font></font>

57
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are you, Xiangyuan?</font></font>

58
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:36,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

59
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How far along?</font></font>

60
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could I have forgotten</font></font>

61
00:03:48,870 --> 00:03:49,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how far along I am?</font></font>

62
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then</font></font>

63
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when did my cousin last leave?</font></font>

64
00:03:59,670 --> 00:04:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you forgotten that too?</font></font>

65
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With you pregnant,</font></font>

66
00:04:08,270 --> 00:04:09,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what was so urgent</font></font>

67
00:04:10,390 --> 00:04:11,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that he had to leave?</font></font>

68
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why do you keep asking me</font></font>

69
00:04:13,210 --> 00:04:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">these questions?</font></font>

70
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've already told you I can't remember.</font></font>

71
00:04:16,910 --> 00:04:17,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's all right.</font></font>

72
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:19,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't have to remember</font></font>

73
00:04:19,390 --> 00:04:20,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the exact date.</font></font>

74
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you must remember roughly when.</font></font>

75
00:04:23,390 --> 00:04:24,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why exactly</font></font>

76
00:04:24,270 --> 00:04:25,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">did my cousin leave?</font></font>

77
00:04:26,390 --> 00:04:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And how did all that village gossip</font></font>

78
00:04:28,230 --> 00:04:29,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">start?</font></font>

79
00:04:30,710 --> 00:04:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll do it.</font></font>

80
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My head hurts so much.</font></font>

81
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry.</font></font>

82
00:04:34,390 --> 00:04:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm dizzy.</font></font>

83
00:04:35,150 --> 00:04:35,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan.</font></font>

84
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take your time.</font></font>

85
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:38,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Try to remember.</font></font>

86
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:39,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because...</font></font>

87
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:40,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why do you always</font></font>

88
00:04:40,790 --> 00:04:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">use that excuse?</font></font>

89
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone in the village says...</font></font>

90
00:04:47,390 --> 00:04:47,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey,</font></font>

91
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:48,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm home.</font></font>

92
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:58,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's been rainy,</font></font>

93
00:04:59,830 --> 00:05:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the mountain paths are muddy.</font></font>

94
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:03,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why I came home late.</font></font>

95
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If the weather was so bad,</font></font>

96
00:05:07,630 --> 00:05:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why did you go into the mountains for herbs?</font></font>

97
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were gone for days.</font></font>

98
00:05:17,190 --> 00:05:17,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To bring you</font></font>

99
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:18,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">something nourishing, of course.</font></font>

100
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All right.</font></font>

101
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was wrong.</font></font>

102
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please don't be angry.</font></font>

103
00:05:24,390 --> 00:05:25,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To make it up to you,</font></font>

104
00:05:25,830 --> 00:05:26,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whatever you ask,</font></font>

105
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll do it.</font></font>

106
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How's that?</font></font>

107
00:05:33,270 --> 00:05:34,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then I want a baby.</font></font>

108
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:39,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll have children someday.</font></font>

109
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:40,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't you say I could</font></font>

110
00:05:40,950 --> 00:05:41,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">ask for anything?</font></font>

111
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why not this?</font></font>

112
00:05:44,830 --> 00:05:46,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm worried about your health.</font></font>

113
00:05:46,070 --> 00:05:46,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why do you always</font></font>

114
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">brush me off with that excuse?</font></font>

115
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's nothing wrong with me.</font></font>

116
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheng Kong, I don't understand.</font></font>

117
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why have you never</font></font>

118
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">slept with me since we married?</font></font>

119
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone says...</font></font>

120
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They say you have</font></font>

121
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">another woman out there.</font></font>

122
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I wanted a child,</font></font>

123
00:06:07,070 --> 00:06:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but Cheng Kong didn't.</font></font>

124
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan,</font></font>

125
00:06:12,830 --> 00:06:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">aren't you</font></font>

126
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">already pregnant?</font></font>

127
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:15,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

128
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:18,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm pregnant.</font></font>

129
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was because I was pregnant</font></font>

130
00:06:22,510 --> 00:06:23,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that the rabbit demon...</font></font>

131
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rabbit demon?</font></font>

132
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't want</font></font>

133
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to remember any of this.</font></font>

134
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did you have to</font></font>

135
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">make me remember?</font></font>

136
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan,</font></font>

137
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:34,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">calm down.</font></font>

138
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I told you</font></font>

139
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't want to remember.</font></font>

140
00:06:36,310 --> 00:06:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stop pushing me!</font></font>

141
00:06:37,390 --> 00:06:37,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan!</font></font>

142
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The rabbit demon really is connected to Cheng Kong.</font></font>

143
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan!</font></font>

144
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan!</font></font>

145
00:06:56,070 --> 00:06:56,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan!</font></font>

146
00:06:57,310 --> 00:06:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan!</font></font>

147
00:07:05,510 --> 00:07:06,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan?</font></font>

148
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan!</font></font>

149
00:07:08,430 --> 00:07:08,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

150
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:09,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take her back.</font></font>

151
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Such a strong demonic aura.</font></font>

152
00:07:46,950 --> 00:07:47,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's the rabbit demon.</font></font>

153
00:07:48,510 --> 00:07:49,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've searched everywhere</font></font>

154
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:50,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and couldn't find it.</font></font>

155
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now it's come to us on its own.</font></font>

156
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't be afraid, Hao.</font></font>

157
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stay behind me.</font></font>

158
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao!</font></font>

159
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take her away.</font></font>

160
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master!</font></font>

161
00:10:00,510 --> 00:10:01,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me back the soul crystal!</font></font>

162
00:10:30,990 --> 00:10:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master!</font></font>

163
00:10:32,850 --> 00:10:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I must regain my powers as soon as possible.</font></font>

164
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know how much</font></font>

165
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that soul crystal means to me.</font></font>

166
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you'd taken proper care of it,</font></font>

167
00:10:43,790 --> 00:10:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it wouldn't have been taken away so easily.</font></font>

168
00:10:47,390 --> 00:10:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Still, you shouldn't have</font></font>

169
00:10:48,570 --> 00:10:49,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">put yourself in danger</font></font>

170
00:10:50,150 --> 00:10:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and put my flower at risk.</font></font>

171
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've put up with you long enough!</font></font>

172
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your powers are back?</font></font>

173
00:11:02,270 --> 00:11:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have enough to deal with you.</font></font>

174
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin,</font></font>

175
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you have something</font></font>

176
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:12,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you care deeply about too.</font></font>

177
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your mystical flower means so much to you.</font></font>

178
00:11:14,790 --> 00:11:16,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So put yourself in my shoes.</font></font>

179
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You should know how it feels</font></font>

180
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to lose something precious.</font></font>

181
00:11:19,510 --> 00:11:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've already told you.</font></font>

182
00:11:21,390 --> 00:11:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After a few days' rest,</font></font>

183
00:11:22,750 --> 00:11:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can overpower the Wanjun Lock again.</font></font>

184
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:26,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll deal with the rabbit demon myself then.</font></font>

185
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:27,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As for you,</font></font>

186
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">stop trying to be clever.</font></font>

187
00:11:30,870 --> 00:11:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If your powers</font></font>

188
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">could solve everything,</font></font>

189
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:34,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why couldn't you reclaim</font></font>

190
00:11:34,910 --> 00:11:36,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your malice from Su Hexiang?</font></font>

191
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since your malice</font></font>

192
00:11:40,750 --> 00:11:41,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">gets entwined with obsession,</font></font>

193
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whether you like it or not,</font></font>

194
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'll have to take</font></font>

195
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:46,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a good look at this world</font></font>

196
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for yourself.</font></font>

197
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll find the rabbit demon</font></font>

198
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and get the soul crystal back.</font></font>

199
00:11:54,030 --> 00:11:55,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If it goes into hiding,</font></font>

200
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll turn this whole mountain upside down.</font></font>

201
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If it's swallowed the crystal,</font></font>

202
00:11:59,910 --> 00:12:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll cut its belly open.</font></font>

203
00:12:02,270 --> 00:12:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as there's the slightest hope,</font></font>

204
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't give up on saving my master.</font></font>

205
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The rabbit demon only appears at night.</font></font>

206
00:12:15,030 --> 00:12:16,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The mountain fog at night</font></font>

207
00:12:16,630 --> 00:12:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">makes people fall asleep.</font></font>

208
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we want to capture the rabbit demon,</font></font>

209
00:12:20,390 --> 00:12:22,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we must first find a way to resist its effects.</font></font>

210
00:12:38,390 --> 00:12:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I could hear all that noise</font></font>

211
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from a long way off.</font></font>

212
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's going on?</font></font>

213
00:12:42,390 --> 00:12:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nothing, Xiangyuan.</font></font>

214
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">About our little misunderstanding yesterday...</font></font>

215
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's not bring up yesterday.</font></font>

216
00:12:48,390 --> 00:12:50,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pregnancy makes me so moody.</font></font>

217
00:12:51,790 --> 00:12:52,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hope I didn't frighten you.</font></font>

218
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not at all.</font></font>

219
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm just glad you're all right.</font></font>

220
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I need to take care of something,</font></font>

221
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I'll skip breakfast.</font></font>

222
00:13:06,270 --> 00:13:06,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao.</font></font>

223
00:13:11,910 --> 00:13:12,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you</font></font>

224
00:13:13,390 --> 00:13:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">worried about High Immortal Danshen?</font></font>

225
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:53,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry.</font></font>

226
00:13:54,790 --> 00:13:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">High Immortal Danshen keeps all evil at bay.</font></font>

227
00:13:56,670 --> 00:13:58,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No ordinary demon would dare harm him.</font></font>

228
00:13:59,120 --> 00:13:59,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll find the crystal</font></font>

229
00:13:59,870 --> 00:14:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in no time.</font></font>

230
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:03,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you, Hao.</font></font>

231
00:14:04,790 --> 00:14:05,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But</font></font>

232
00:14:05,790 --> 00:14:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wasn't crying.</font></font>

233
00:14:23,150 --> 00:14:24,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's no point</font></font>

234
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in being upset now.</font></font>

235
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:26,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know that.</font></font>

236
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:27,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The priority</font></font>

237
00:14:27,870 --> 00:14:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is to gather all these herbs.</font></font>

238
00:14:29,550 --> 00:14:30,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's quite a long list.</font></font>

239
00:14:33,270 --> 00:14:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can these herbs help us</font></font>

240
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">fight the rabbit demon?</font></font>

241
00:14:36,790 --> 00:14:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They can't,</font></font>

242
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but they can protect us from the fog at night.</font></font>

243
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So it's not demonic power that's been</font></font>

244
00:14:44,870 --> 00:14:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">making us pass out at night.</font></font>

245
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:48,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How did you find that out?</font></font>

246
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Never mind that.</font></font>

247
00:14:50,870 --> 00:14:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once we've gathered these herbs,</font></font>

248
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:53,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll make a remedy from them.</font></font>

249
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It'll help us</font></font>

250
00:14:54,550 --> 00:14:55,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">hold our breath</font></font>

251
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so the fog at night won't affect us.</font></font>

252
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then we can find out</font></font>

253
00:14:58,030 --> 00:14:59,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what's really happening in the village.</font></font>

254
00:15:23,790 --> 00:15:24,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao.</font></font>

255
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've gathered all the herbs,</font></font>

256
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">except the fruit at the top of this tree.</font></font>

257
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll do it.</font></font>

258
00:15:38,150 --> 00:15:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You?</font></font>

259
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:40,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you forgotten</font></font>

260
00:15:40,790 --> 00:15:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I grew up in Luoshen Valley?</font></font>

261
00:15:42,870 --> 00:15:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is easy for me.</font></font>

262
00:16:04,750 --> 00:16:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's so funny?</font></font>

263
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:11,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're so agile, Yamao.</font></font>

264
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:14,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From a distance, you look a bit like...</font></font>

265
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a wild monkey.</font></font>

266
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:18,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

267
00:16:25,730 --> 00:16:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Catch.</font></font>

268
00:16:45,670 --> 00:16:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This fruit's really sweet. Try it.</font></font>

269
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bitter, isn't it?</font></font>

270
00:16:58,910 --> 00:17:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Consider it</font></font>

271
00:17:00,220 --> 00:17:01,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a little punishment.</font></font>

272
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe you'll think twice next time.</font></font>

273
00:17:03,030 --> 00:17:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't mean to offend you.</font></font>

274
00:17:05,110 --> 00:17:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That was</font></font>

275
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for your little scheme</font></font>

276
00:17:08,310 --> 00:17:09,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to steal your spiritual mark back.</font></font>

277
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luckily, your conscience kicked in, and you stopped</font></font>

278
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in time.</font></font>

279
00:17:16,830 --> 00:17:17,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rinse your mouth.</font></font>

280
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry. It's not poisoned.</font></font>

281
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're still in the mood to tease me?</font></font>

282
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It beats driving myself crazy with worry.</font></font>

283
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That little doll demon</font></font>

284
00:17:47,350 --> 00:17:48,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is hiding something from you.</font></font>

285
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you keep letting Qi Fengyin</font></font>

286
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">water the mystical flower,</font></font>

287
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you won't be able to withstand</font></font>

288
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the damage done by his malice,</font></font>

289
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you'll end up dead.</font></font>

290
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know.</font></font>

291
00:18:02,550 --> 00:18:03,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But the well water</font></font>

292
00:18:03,790 --> 00:18:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">can keep me alive.</font></font>

293
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:06,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Besides,</font></font>

294
00:18:06,310 --> 00:18:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for the sake of the flower,</font></font>

295
00:18:07,310 --> 00:18:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin won't let me die.</font></font>

296
00:18:08,790 --> 00:18:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He kills on a whim.</font></font>

297
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He unleashed a firestorm on Luoshen Valley</font></font>

298
00:18:12,070 --> 00:18:13,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and gravely wounded High Immortal Danshen.</font></font>

299
00:18:14,030 --> 00:18:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How can you trust him with your life?</font></font>

300
00:18:15,830 --> 00:18:19,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The barrier on Mount Qihuang was still intact then.</font></font>

301
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin was still sealed inside.</font></font>

302
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:24,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't it possible</font></font>

303
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that the firestorm in Luoshen Valley</font></font>

304
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wasn't his doing?</font></font>

305
00:18:27,790 --> 00:18:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nonsense.</font></font>

306
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin's scattered malice</font></font>

307
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:35,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is drawn to people consumed by obsession.</font></font>

308
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whether at Mount Leiguan</font></font>

309
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or in this little village,</font></font>

310
00:18:39,830 --> 00:18:41,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wherever that malice goes,</font></font>

311
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">innocent people</font></font>

312
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:43,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">get caught up in it.</font></font>

313
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:46,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You may not believe this,</font></font>

314
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but my master</font></font>

315
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">used to be all I cared about.</font></font>

316
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since leaving Luoshen Valley</font></font>

317
00:18:52,550 --> 00:18:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and going through all this,</font></font>

318
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've realized</font></font>

319
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:58,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that besides seeking Master's protection,</font></font>

320
00:18:59,110 --> 00:19:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can protect the people</font></font>

321
00:19:00,250 --> 00:19:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I care about too.</font></font>

322
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I may be weak,</font></font>

323
00:19:07,310 --> 00:19:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I'm just like this fruit.</font></font>

324
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With its vine winding around the tree trunk</font></font>

325
00:19:12,110 --> 00:19:12,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and climbing to the top,</font></font>

326
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it eventually becomes</font></font>

327
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a useful Sunward Fruit.</font></font>

328
00:19:15,830 --> 00:19:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A fruit,</font></font>

329
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:17,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a flower,</font></font>

330
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a vine...</font></font>

331
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All things in this world</font></font>

332
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">draw on what's around them to survive</font></font>

333
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and become something better.</font></font>

334
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:30,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I should do the same.</font></font>

335
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:40,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All right. Let's head back.</font></font>

336
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since your malice</font></font>

337
00:19:59,790 --> 00:20:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">gets entwined with obsession,</font></font>

338
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:02,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whether you like it or not,</font></font>

339
00:20:03,110 --> 00:20:04,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'll have to take</font></font>

340
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a good look at this world</font></font>

341
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for yourself.</font></font>

342
00:20:29,510 --> 00:20:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me.</font></font>

343
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:41,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought you'd ignore me after all the nonsense</font></font>

344
00:20:41,400 --> 00:20:42,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I said yesterday.</font></font>

345
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:44,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did I often lose my temper?</font></font>

346
00:20:44,830 --> 00:20:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were always gentle</font></font>

347
00:20:47,240 --> 00:20:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and never really lost your temper.</font></font>

348
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:50,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why, since you came back,</font></font>

349
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you've seemed like a stranger to me.</font></font>

350
00:20:52,350 --> 00:20:54,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sometimes I even wake with a start</font></font>

351
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and feel as if this is all a dream.</font></font>

352
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then what was</font></font>

353
00:20:59,070 --> 00:21:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Cheng Kong you knew like?</font></font>

354
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:02,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were patient with me</font></font>

355
00:21:03,830 --> 00:21:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and always took good care of me.</font></font>

356
00:21:05,830 --> 00:21:07,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We grew up together</font></font>

357
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and fell in love.</font></font>

358
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We came here to live in seclusion.</font></font>

359
00:21:13,070 --> 00:21:14,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But our happiness didn't last.</font></font>

360
00:21:16,070 --> 00:21:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You kept leaving me alone,</font></font>

361
00:21:18,270 --> 00:21:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">going away for days at a time</font></font>

362
00:21:20,030 --> 00:21:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">without ever telling me why.</font></font>

363
00:21:21,510 --> 00:21:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't know where you went.</font></font>

364
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:24,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was so scared.</font></font>

365
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone in the village said</font></font>

366
00:21:27,510 --> 00:21:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'd grown tired of me</font></font>

367
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:30,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and were secretly keeping a mistress.</font></font>

368
00:21:31,550 --> 00:21:32,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The last time you left,</font></font>

369
00:21:34,640 --> 00:21:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I cried for so long.</font></font>

370
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:39,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought you'd never come back.</font></font>

371
00:21:41,270 --> 00:21:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who did you see last,</font></font>

372
00:21:45,030 --> 00:21:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">me</font></font>

373
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or Cheng Kong?</font></font>

374
00:21:57,510 --> 00:21:58,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're not Cheng Kong.</font></font>

375
00:21:59,160 --> 00:21:59,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who are you?</font></font>

376
00:22:09,070 --> 00:22:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan was so close</font></font>

377
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to remembering everything.</font></font>

378
00:22:12,830 --> 00:22:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once her memory returns,</font></font>

379
00:22:14,830 --> 00:22:16,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we can solve all these mysteries.</font></font>

380
00:22:20,550 --> 00:22:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When the rabbit demon appeared last night,</font></font>

381
00:22:22,830 --> 00:22:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it seemed intent on keeping us from learning the truth.</font></font>

382
00:22:25,290 --> 00:22:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It went straight for Xiangyuan.</font></font>

383
00:22:29,430 --> 00:22:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If not for Qi Fengyin,</font></font>

384
00:22:31,160 --> 00:22:32,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it would probably have killed her.</font></font>

385
00:22:48,550 --> 00:22:49,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This jade pendant</font></font>

386
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">looks so familiar.</font></font>

387
00:22:51,310 --> 00:22:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me see.</font></font>

388
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:01,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The rabbit demon had one last night.</font></font>

389
00:23:01,830 --> 00:23:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could it be</font></font>

390
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that it ate Cheng Kong</font></font>

391
00:23:04,270 --> 00:23:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and stole his things?</font></font>

392
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then</font></font>

393
00:23:06,640 --> 00:23:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why is the rabbit demon so determined</font></font>

394
00:23:08,290 --> 00:23:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to hurt the two of them?</font></font>

395
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:11,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since it's after Xiangyuan,</font></font>

396
00:23:11,270 --> 00:23:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the rabbit demon</font></font>

397
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:13,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will surely return tonight.</font></font>

398
00:23:25,110 --> 00:23:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's see where</font></font>

399
00:23:25,830 --> 00:23:26,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that rabbit can run tonight.</font></font>

400
00:23:28,830 --> 00:23:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's here.</font></font>

401
00:24:15,110 --> 00:24:15,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao,</font></font>

402
00:24:16,070 --> 00:24:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what's wrong?</font></font>

403
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's happened to Yamao?</font></font>

404
00:24:39,350 --> 00:24:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The demonic aura has affected her.</font></font>

405
00:24:40,790 --> 00:24:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's become a mindless husk too.</font></font>

406
00:24:42,790 --> 00:24:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why aren't we affected?</font></font>

407
00:24:45,270 --> 00:24:46,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is there a way to turn her back?</font></font>

408
00:24:46,090 --> 00:24:47,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We may have to wait until dawn.</font></font>

409
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll keep her under control.</font></font>

410
00:24:50,240 --> 00:24:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The rabbit demon's still nearby.</font></font>

411
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go after it.</font></font>

412
00:24:52,480 --> 00:24:53,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Make sure you bring back</font></font>

413
00:24:53,240 --> 00:24:54,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">her master's soul crystal.</font></font>

414
00:24:54,350 --> 00:24:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know</font></font>

415
00:24:55,270 --> 00:24:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what to do.</font></font>

416
00:24:59,550 --> 00:25:00,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao.</font></font>

417
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao!</font></font>

418
00:25:56,880 --> 00:25:59,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Kill it! - Kill it!</font></font>

419
00:26:00,110 --> 00:26:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't hurt him!</font></font>

420
00:26:01,110 --> 00:26:02,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Kill it! - Kill it!</font></font>

421
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:15,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Kill it! - Kill it!</font></font>

422
00:26:24,600 --> 00:26:25,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's going on?</font></font>

423
00:26:25,350 --> 00:26:25,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They...</font></font>

424
00:26:46,910 --> 00:26:48,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We were all wrong.</font></font>

425
00:26:48,220 --> 00:26:49,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The demonic power affecting the villagers</font></font>

426
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't from the rabbit demon.</font></font>

427
00:26:52,550 --> 00:26:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're yourself again?</font></font>

428
00:27:04,030 --> 00:27:05,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if I knock her out again,</font></font>

429
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she'll wake up soon.</font></font>

430
00:27:07,510 --> 00:27:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't keep doing this.</font></font>

431
00:28:22,310 --> 00:28:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you find it?</font></font>

432
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I lost track of it</font></font>

433
00:28:26,750 --> 00:28:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">deep in the mountains.</font></font>

434
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your wound...</font></font>

435
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's nothing.</font></font>

436
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:36,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's Yamao?</font></font>

437
00:28:41,350 --> 00:28:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My head hurts.</font></font>

438
00:28:43,720 --> 00:28:44,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened?</font></font>

439
00:28:44,720 --> 00:28:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Weren't we after the rabbit demon?</font></font>

440
00:28:45,920 --> 00:28:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">While we were hunting it last night,</font></font>

441
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:48,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you suddenly lost control</font></font>

442
00:28:49,350 --> 00:28:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and became mindless.</font></font>

443
00:28:51,790 --> 00:28:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

444
00:28:55,590 --> 00:28:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why can't I remember any of it?</font></font>

445
00:28:58,960 --> 00:29:00,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you get the soul crystal back?</font></font>

446
00:29:00,270 --> 00:29:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ask him yourself.</font></font>

447
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I lost track of it.</font></font>

448
00:29:06,070 --> 00:29:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you turned mindless last night,</font></font>

449
00:29:07,750 --> 00:29:08,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you said something.</font></font>

450
00:29:10,070 --> 00:29:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You said the demonic power</font></font>

451
00:29:11,310 --> 00:29:12,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">affecting this village</font></font>

452
00:29:13,110 --> 00:29:14,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wasn't from the rabbit demon.</font></font>

453
00:29:16,480 --> 00:29:17,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you see something?</font></font>

454
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

455
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:26,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really can't</font></font>

456
00:29:26,510 --> 00:29:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">remember anything.</font></font>

457
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

458
00:29:29,510 --> 00:29:30,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All I know is...</font></font>

459
00:29:35,510 --> 00:29:36,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my teeth hurt.</font></font>

460
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:39,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You spent all night biting everything in sight.</font></font>

461
00:29:39,920 --> 00:29:40,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course your teeth hurt.</font></font>

462
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

463
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:46,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That wound...</font></font>

464
00:29:46,920 --> 00:29:47,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It has nothing to do with you.</font></font>

465
00:29:56,830 --> 00:29:57,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why was I</font></font>

466
00:29:58,080 --> 00:29:59,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the only one who turned into a mindless husk?</font></font>

467
00:30:08,310 --> 00:30:09,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When we were hunting the rabbit demon,</font></font>

468
00:30:10,070 --> 00:30:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was the only one who attacked it.</font></font>

469
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:13,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could it be</font></font>

470
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">only those who've attacked the rabbit demon</font></font>

471
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:16,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">turn into mindless husks?</font></font>

472
00:30:34,270 --> 00:30:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you catch the rabbit demon?</font></font>

473
00:30:39,030 --> 00:30:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't blame me for this.</font></font>

474
00:30:40,160 --> 00:30:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You left me alone to watch her.</font></font>

475
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She turns into a mindless husk at night.</font></font>

476
00:30:44,110 --> 00:30:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I had to tie her up so she wouldn't bite me.</font></font>

477
00:30:46,240 --> 00:30:47,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did she act any differently last night?</font></font>

478
00:30:49,400 --> 00:30:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Same as usual.</font></font>

479
00:30:50,550 --> 00:30:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She slept for a while,</font></font>

480
00:30:51,360 --> 00:30:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then thrashed around all night.</font></font>

481
00:30:52,550 --> 00:30:53,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At dawn, she fell asleep again.</font></font>

482
00:31:23,030 --> 00:31:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's with that look?</font></font>

483
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is she dying?</font></font>

484
00:31:25,790 --> 00:31:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan's fine.</font></font>

485
00:31:27,790 --> 00:31:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But</font></font>

486
00:31:29,310 --> 00:31:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she's not pregnant.</font></font>

487
00:31:30,400 --> 00:31:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

488
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then why does she keep saying</font></font>

489
00:31:33,550 --> 00:31:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she's pregnant?</font></font>

490
00:31:34,270 --> 00:31:35,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan can't even tell</font></font>

491
00:31:35,540 --> 00:31:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who her own husband is.</font></font>

492
00:31:37,270 --> 00:31:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's no surprise she doesn't know</font></font>

493
00:31:39,030 --> 00:31:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whether she's pregnant.</font></font>

494
00:31:40,550 --> 00:31:42,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What I can't understand</font></font>

495
00:31:42,550 --> 00:31:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is why the rabbit demon</font></font>

496
00:31:43,440 --> 00:31:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is so determined to hurt them both.</font></font>

497
00:31:46,030 --> 00:31:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At this point,</font></font>

498
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll have to wait until I turn mindless tonight</font></font>

499
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to keep investigating.</font></font>

500
00:31:50,750 --> 00:31:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You turned mindless?</font></font>

501
00:31:52,680 --> 00:31:53,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened last night?</font></font>

502
00:31:53,830 --> 00:31:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's a long story.</font></font>

503
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:56,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anyway,</font></font>

504
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I already have a plan.</font></font>

505
00:32:05,270 --> 00:32:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao...</font></font>

506
00:32:13,030 --> 00:32:13,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stand right here.</font></font>

507
00:32:14,550 --> 00:32:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tell me the truth.</font></font>

508
00:32:15,960 --> 00:32:17,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you planning to give Yuwen Hao</font></font>

509
00:32:17,110 --> 00:32:17,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his spiritual mark back?</font></font>

510
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:19,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Desperate times, desperate measures.</font></font>

511
00:32:19,750 --> 00:32:21,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I turn mindless tonight,</font></font>

512
00:32:21,440 --> 00:32:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll only be a burden.</font></font>

513
00:32:22,420 --> 00:32:23,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin already has his hands full</font></font>

514
00:32:23,910 --> 00:32:24,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">dealing with me.</font></font>

515
00:32:24,880 --> 00:32:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To keep everyone safe,</font></font>

516
00:32:26,160 --> 00:32:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">hold off the mindless husks, and buy time,</font></font>

517
00:32:28,110 --> 00:32:29,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'll have to rely on Hao.</font></font>

518
00:32:29,350 --> 00:32:30,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you out of your mind?</font></font>

519
00:32:30,550 --> 00:32:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just think for a moment.</font></font>

520
00:32:32,270 --> 00:32:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did he follow you</font></font>

521
00:32:33,010 --> 00:32:33,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all the way here?</font></font>

522
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once Yuwen Hao gets his powers back,</font></font>

523
00:32:36,400 --> 00:32:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do you think you'll survive?</font></font>

524
00:32:38,550 --> 00:32:39,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm afraid it won't be</font></font>

525
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:41,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the mindless husks that kill you.</font></font>

526
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It'll be</font></font>

527
00:32:41,920 --> 00:32:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his sword.</font></font>

528
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take that chance.</font></font>

529
00:32:45,510 --> 00:32:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take that chance? You'll stake your life</font></font>

530
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on that sect lackey's conscience?</font></font>

531
00:32:49,070 --> 00:32:50,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't be ridiculous.</font></font>

532
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:05,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao still</font></font>

533
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has a soft spot for me.</font></font>

534
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He was the one who helped me</font></font>

535
00:33:09,880 --> 00:33:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">avoid the traps outside the village.</font></font>

536
00:33:12,550 --> 00:33:13,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right now,</font></font>

537
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have no choice</font></font>

538
00:33:15,830 --> 00:33:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but to trust him.</font></font>

539
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:18,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At the very least,</font></font>

540
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'll help me save Master.</font></font>

541
00:33:23,640 --> 00:33:25,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll return his spiritual mark first.</font></font>

542
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

543
00:33:39,640 --> 00:33:40,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Which sect are you from?</font></font>

544
00:33:41,200 --> 00:33:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why haven't I seen you before?</font></font>

545
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We come from a minor sect.</font></font>

546
00:33:44,110 --> 00:33:45,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once we've cut out your herb core</font></font>

547
00:33:45,350 --> 00:33:46,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and taken it to Mount Zhaowu,</font></font>

548
00:33:46,440 --> 00:33:47,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'll be famous throughout the world.</font></font>

549
00:34:10,590 --> 00:34:11,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao,</font></font>

550
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I... I was going</font></font>

551
00:34:12,630 --> 00:34:13,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to give it back to you anyway.</font></font>

552
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:24,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master Yuwen?</font></font>

553
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:28,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">May I ask</font></font>

554
00:34:29,440 --> 00:34:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">which sect you two belong to</font></font>

555
00:34:31,360 --> 00:34:32,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and what brings you here?</font></font>

556
00:34:32,550 --> 00:34:33,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You may not have heard, sir.</font></font>

557
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mount Zhaowu has sent word to all the immortal sects.</font></font>

558
00:34:36,110 --> 00:34:37,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Disciples from every sect</font></font>

559
00:34:37,400 --> 00:34:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are hunting this herb spirit</font></font>

560
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to retrieve her herb core</font></font>

561
00:34:40,360 --> 00:34:41,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and revive the Saintess of the Tides.</font></font>

562
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How fortunate</font></font>

563
00:34:42,670 --> 00:34:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to meet you here, Master Yuwen.</font></font>

564
00:34:44,070 --> 00:34:46,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now this herb spirit has nowhere to run.</font></font>

565
00:34:52,770 --> 00:34:53,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You liar.</font></font>

566
00:34:53,750 --> 00:34:54,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never should've trusted you!</font></font>

567
00:35:05,030 --> 00:35:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master Yuwen,</font></font>

568
00:35:06,440 --> 00:35:07,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what are you doing?</font></font>

569
00:35:07,710 --> 00:35:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as I hold this sword,</font></font>

570
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">no one will lay a finger on her.</font></font>

571
00:35:13,320 --> 00:35:14,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple.</font></font>

572
00:35:15,190 --> 00:35:16,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How can you protect her in defiance</font></font>

573
00:35:16,280 --> 00:35:17,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of your sect's orders?</font></font>

574
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about the future of the world?</font></font>

575
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll keep her safe.</font></font>

576
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:22,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I'll keep</font></font>

577
00:35:23,710 --> 00:35:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the world safe too.</font></font>

578
00:35:28,280 --> 00:35:29,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't have it both ways.</font></font>

579
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:31,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">By doing this,</font></font>

580
00:35:31,710 --> 00:35:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're betraying not only Mount Zhaowu</font></font>

581
00:35:33,320 --> 00:35:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but also all the other immortal sects!</font></font>

582
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:36,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My mind is made up.</font></font>

583
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:41,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fine.</font></font>

584
00:35:41,960 --> 00:35:43,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll tell all the immortal sects</font></font>

585
00:35:43,360 --> 00:35:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what you've done.</font></font>

586
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:45,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao,</font></font>

587
00:35:46,000 --> 00:35:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you...</font></font>

588
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:47,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'd better watch yourself!</font></font>

589
00:35:48,190 --> 00:35:48,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

590
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you, Hao.</font></font>

591
00:35:58,110 --> 00:35:58,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I'm not a liar anymore?</font></font>

592
00:35:59,110 --> 00:36:00,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was just panicking.</font></font>

593
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're going to report you to Mount Zhaowu.</font></font>

594
00:36:04,510 --> 00:36:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How will you face</font></font>

595
00:36:05,840 --> 00:36:06,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the immortal sects after this?</font></font>

596
00:36:06,840 --> 00:36:07,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's focus on what's at hand first.</font></font>

597
00:36:10,800 --> 00:36:12,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My Lord, do it.</font></font>

598
00:36:12,670 --> 00:36:13,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do what?</font></font>

599
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did everything I could</font></font>

600
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to talk Yamao out of it,</font></font>

601
00:36:16,110 --> 00:36:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but she's so stubborn.</font></font>

602
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:18,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When it comes</font></font>

603
00:36:18,760 --> 00:36:19,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to her master,</font></font>

604
00:36:19,800 --> 00:36:21,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she refuses to see sense.</font></font>

605
00:36:21,510 --> 00:36:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">By now, she's probably</font></font>

606
00:36:22,510 --> 00:36:23,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">given Yuwen Hao</font></font>

607
00:36:23,280 --> 00:36:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his spiritual mark back.</font></font>

608
00:36:24,510 --> 00:36:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take back the wisp</font></font>

609
00:36:25,320 --> 00:36:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of dark energy you gave me to help me</font></font>

610
00:36:26,580 --> 00:36:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">take human form.</font></font>

611
00:36:27,330 --> 00:36:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It might restore some of your power and help you</font></font>

612
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:30,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">fight that lackey.</font></font>

613
00:36:30,510 --> 00:36:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The power I gave you to take human form</font></font>

614
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is insignificant.</font></font>

615
00:36:33,150 --> 00:36:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Taking it back won't help.</font></font>

616
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then what do we do?</font></font>

617
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:38,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What if Yamao really...?</font></font>

618
00:36:52,920 --> 00:36:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fighting now</font></font>

619
00:36:53,590 --> 00:36:54,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">won't get you anywhere.</font></font>

620
00:36:55,150 --> 00:36:55,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Settle your scores</font></font>

621
00:36:56,150 --> 00:36:57,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">after we deal with the rabbit demon.</font></font>

622
00:37:05,800 --> 00:37:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao, you'll handle</font></font>

623
00:37:06,920 --> 00:37:07,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the mindless husks in the village.</font></font>

624
00:37:08,630 --> 00:37:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Remember,</font></font>

625
00:37:09,030 --> 00:37:10,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">don't let them near Xiangyuan's house.</font></font>

626
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If the rabbit demon appears,</font></font>

627
00:37:11,480 --> 00:37:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">capture it first.</font></font>

628
00:37:13,840 --> 00:37:14,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Youyou,</font></font>

629
00:37:14,590 --> 00:37:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">watch Xiangyuan.</font></font>

630
00:37:15,550 --> 00:37:16,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't let her wander off.</font></font>

631
00:37:18,630 --> 00:37:20,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Given what I said last night,</font></font>

632
00:37:21,150 --> 00:37:22,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I must have discovered something</font></font>

633
00:37:23,070 --> 00:37:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">after I turned mindless.</font></font>

634
00:37:24,360 --> 00:37:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I can stay lucid</font></font>

635
00:37:25,550 --> 00:37:26,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">during that time,</font></font>

636
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:27,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can tell you</font></font>

637
00:37:27,890 --> 00:37:28,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everything I see,</font></font>

638
00:37:29,110 --> 00:37:30,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and we can solve the mystery.</font></font>

639
00:37:30,550 --> 00:37:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How will you stay lucid?</font></font>

640
00:37:33,840 --> 00:37:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Last night,</font></font>

641
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:36,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you hit me and snapped me out of it.</font></font>

642
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:37,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That means</font></font>

643
00:37:38,070 --> 00:37:39,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">pain can keep me lucid.</font></font>

644
00:37:39,550 --> 00:37:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's just speculation.</font></font>

645
00:37:41,630 --> 00:37:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The damage from his dark energy</font></font>

646
00:37:42,920 --> 00:37:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has left you weak and drained.</font></font>

647
00:37:44,360 --> 00:37:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who knows how much pain you'll suffer</font></font>

648
00:37:46,510 --> 00:37:47,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">trying to piece together the truth?</font></font>

649
00:37:48,670 --> 00:37:49,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Besides,</font></font>

650
00:37:50,150 --> 00:37:51,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it might not even work.</font></font>

651
00:37:55,230 --> 00:37:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whether it works or not,</font></font>

652
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:57,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to give it a try.</font></font>

653
00:37:57,440 --> 00:37:58,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My master's soul crystal</font></font>

654
00:37:58,190 --> 00:37:59,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is still with the rabbit demon.</font></font>

655
00:37:59,800 --> 00:38:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Until I get it back,</font></font>

656
00:38:00,840 --> 00:38:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't have a moment's peace.</font></font>

657
00:38:02,360 --> 00:38:03,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's a little pain?</font></font>

658
00:38:04,110 --> 00:38:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if I have to risk my life,</font></font>

659
00:38:05,880 --> 00:38:06,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm willing to do it.</font></font>

660
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't take that risk.</font></font>

661
00:38:10,800 --> 00:38:12,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave it to me.</font></font>

662
00:38:13,360 --> 00:38:13,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

663
00:38:14,190 --> 00:38:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we're both out of action,</font></font>

664
00:38:15,190 --> 00:38:16,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">our chances will be even worse.</font></font>

665
00:38:17,360 --> 00:38:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry.</font></font>

666
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can take it.</font></font>

667
00:38:56,630 --> 00:38:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's working.</font></font>

668
00:38:58,150 --> 00:38:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just saw something.</font></font>

669
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:03,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Make sure you snap me out of it again.</font></font>

670
00:39:04,710 --> 00:39:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you're in so much pain.</font></font>

671
00:39:08,320 --> 00:39:09,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't know</font></font>

672
00:39:09,110 --> 00:39:10,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'd care about that.</font></font>

673
00:39:24,150 --> 00:39:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheng Kong</font></font>

674
00:39:25,150 --> 00:39:26,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has been going away all the time</font></font>

675
00:39:26,630 --> 00:39:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">ever since he moved to our village.</font></font>

676
00:39:28,070 --> 00:39:28,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's hardly ever home.</font></font>

677
00:39:29,360 --> 00:39:30,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's keeping him so busy?</font></font>

678
00:39:31,400 --> 00:39:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe he's secretly keeping a mistress.</font></font>

679
00:39:33,510 --> 00:39:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

680
00:39:35,150 --> 00:39:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just look at Xiangyuan.</font></font>

681
00:39:36,760 --> 00:39:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She eats too much and is dim-witted.</font></font>

682
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:39,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheng Kong has to</font></font>

683
00:39:39,710 --> 00:39:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">handle everything.</font></font>

684
00:39:41,630 --> 00:39:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Those two</font></font>

685
00:39:43,230 --> 00:39:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are a terrible match.</font></font>

686
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:46,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's true.</font></font>

687
00:39:46,960 --> 00:39:47,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They've been married</font></font>

688
00:39:47,960 --> 00:39:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for quite a while, haven't they?</font></font>

689
00:39:49,350 --> 00:39:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yet Xiangyuan</font></font>

690
00:39:50,910 --> 00:39:52,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">still isn't pregnant.</font></font>

691
00:39:52,570 --> 00:39:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're right.</font></font>

692
00:39:56,710 --> 00:39:57,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey.</font></font>

693
00:39:58,590 --> 00:39:59,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm home.</font></font>

694
00:40:01,630 --> 00:40:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a little late tonight.</font></font>

695
00:40:03,550 --> 00:40:04,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Next time, go to bed earlier.</font></font>

696
00:40:05,030 --> 00:40:05,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't wait up for me.</font></font>

697
00:40:22,280 --> 00:40:24,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who's upset you, honey?</font></font>

698
00:40:26,110 --> 00:40:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where have you been?</font></font>

699
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:28,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't you remember?</font></font>

700
00:40:29,190 --> 00:40:30,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I went looking for the source of the well water.</font></font>

701
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're lying.</font></font>

702
00:40:35,630 --> 00:40:36,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've been trying to avoid me.</font></font>

703
00:40:36,670 --> 00:40:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why you're always away</font></font>

704
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from home.</font></font>

705
00:40:39,550 --> 00:40:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course not.</font></font>

706
00:40:41,320 --> 00:40:42,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got such a lovely wife.</font></font>

707
00:40:42,760 --> 00:40:44,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I didn't have important things to do,</font></font>

708
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd spend every day</font></font>

709
00:40:45,510 --> 00:40:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with you.</font></font>

710
00:40:48,400 --> 00:40:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you really love me so much,</font></font>

711
00:40:51,030 --> 00:40:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why haven't you slept with me</font></font>

712
00:40:52,630 --> 00:40:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in all the years we've been married?</font></font>

713
00:40:56,510 --> 00:40:59,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know I'm stupid and eat too much.</font></font>

714
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not much to look at either.</font></font>

715
00:41:04,110 --> 00:41:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You just don't want me</font></font>

716
00:41:04,960 --> 00:41:06,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to have your baby.</font></font>

717
00:41:06,550 --> 00:41:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't be silly.</font></font>

718
00:41:07,590 --> 00:41:08,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course I do.</font></font>

719
00:41:12,480 --> 00:41:13,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's just</font></font>

720
00:41:13,960 --> 00:41:15,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">not the right time yet.</font></font>

721
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:17,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to find</font></font>

722
00:41:17,030 --> 00:41:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the source of the well water.</font></font>

723
00:41:24,280 --> 00:41:24,970
