724
00:41:26,070 --> 00:41:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">don't worry.</font></font>

725
00:41:31,190 --> 00:41:32,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've already found a lead.</font></font>

726
00:41:34,230 --> 00:41:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It won't take long.</font></font>

727
00:41:36,630 --> 00:41:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just wait a bit longer.</font></font>

728
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:41,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It won't take long.</font></font>

729
00:41:45,400 --> 00:41:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honey,</font></font>

730
00:41:47,360 --> 00:41:48,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't wait any longer.</font></font>

731
00:41:48,510 --> 00:41:50,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't let you lie to me again.</font></font>

732
00:41:50,710 --> 00:41:51,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiangyuan,</font></font>

733
00:41:52,150 --> 00:41:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">no.</font></font>

734
00:41:54,030 --> 00:41:54,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, Xiangyuan.</font></font>

735
00:42:12,150 --> 00:42:13,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This mystical flower</font></font>

736
00:42:14,320 --> 00:42:15,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is a woman's spirit.</font></font>

737
00:42:16,510 --> 00:42:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I'm not trying to bring her back</font></font>

738
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because I love her.</font></font>

739
00:42:19,590 --> 00:42:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then why?</font></font>

740
00:42:21,150 --> 00:42:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I want to kill her myself.</font></font>

741
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:25,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I finally</font></font>

742
00:42:25,510 --> 00:42:26,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have my husband back.</font></font>

743
00:42:27,510 --> 00:42:29,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't let you ruin it!</font></font>

744
00:42:50,860 --> 00:42:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪</font></font>

745
00:42:55,140 --> 00:42:58,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪So many longings♪</font></font>

746
00:42:59,260 --> 00:43:01,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Linger in the web of fate♪</font></font>

747
00:43:01,540 --> 00:43:06,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪</font></font>

748
00:43:07,460 --> 00:43:11,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Before seas turn to fields♪</font></font>

749
00:43:11,740 --> 00:43:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪</font></font>

750
00:43:15,860 --> 00:43:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪One look into each other's eyes♪</font></font>

751
00:43:18,140 --> 00:43:25,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And we fall in love in an instant♪</font></font>

752
00:43:26,940 --> 00:43:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪</font></font>

753
00:43:30,860 --> 00:43:34,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪</font></font>

754
00:43:35,180 --> 00:43:38,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The wish we made in the long night♪</font></font>

755
00:43:39,060 --> 00:43:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Still waits to come true♪</font></font>

756
00:43:43,460 --> 00:43:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪</font></font>

757
00:43:47,700 --> 00:43:51,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll stay by your side♪</font></font>

758
